{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall count.</b> Apparently it implies that it comes to teach that there is a commandment to count days and weeks, like the counting of the Omer. And if you ask regarding a zavah, for which it is written וספרה, she should recite a blessing, like with the counting of the Omer — the answer is: perhaps she will see [blood] and invalidate [her count], and the blessing would turn out to be in vain."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:29.198732561Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}